<refsynopsisdiv>
<programlisting language="C">#include &lt;SilikoCore/Node.h&gt;</programlisting>
<programlisting language="C">enum SilikoNodeStatus SilikoNodeGetStatus(
    const SilikoNode *object);</programlisting>
</refsynopsisdiv>

<refsection>
<title>Description</title>
<para>The `SilikoSyntaxTreeGetType` function gets the type of the
`SyntaxTreeNodeObject`.

* `SyntaxTree` is the syntax tree node to prove for its type.</para>
</refsection>

<refsection>
<title>Return Values</title>

<para>`SilikoSyntaxTreeGetType` returns a value indicating
whether the syntax tree node is a leaf, branch, error, or nothing.</para>
</refsection>
